+<p>Subsec. (d)(4). <a href="/rio/citation/Pub._L._99-272">Pub. L. 99–272, § 13204(a)</a>, in amending par. (4) generally, designated existing provisions as introductory clause of par. (4), struck out “a monthly benefit under section 3(a), 3(f)(3), 4(a), or 4(f) of the <a href="/topn/railroad_retirement_act_of_1935">Railroad Retirement Act of 1974</a>”, and added cls. (A) and (B).</p>
+<p>Subsec. (d)(5). <a href="/rio/citation/Pub._L._99-272">Pub. L. 99–272, § 12111(b)</a>, added par. (5).</p>
